SUMMARY:Tommy James & The Shondells
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $59 $69 $79 $89 \nRelive the soundtrack of a generation when Tommy James & The Shondells take the stage for a night of nonstop hits and pure nostalgia. With an incredible string of chart-topping classics\, this legendary group helped define the sound of the late ’60s and early ’70s — and their music continues to ignite audiences around the world. \nSing along to iconic favorites like “Crimson and Clover\,” “Mony Mony\,” “I Think We’re Alone Now\,” “Hanky Panky\,” and “Mirage.” Packed with unforgettable melodies\, driving rhythms\, and timeless pop-rock energy\, this concert delivers hit after hit in a high-octane live performance that spans decades of musical history. \nWhether you grew up with these songs on the radio or discovered them through movies\, commercials\, and modern covers\, Tommy James & The Shondells bring a feel-good evening of classic rock that’s perfect for fans of all ages. Don’t miss your chance to experience these legendary songs performed live — a night of memories\, music\, and pure fun awaits. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/tommy-james-the-shondells/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
