SUMMARY:Get the Led Out
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $34 $44 $54 $64 \nGet The Led Out (GTLO) brings the thunderous power\, mystique\, and musical depth of Led Zeppelin to the stage in a high-energy live concert experience. This Philadelphia-based group of six seasoned musicians delivers Zeppelin’s legendary catalog with stunning precision—recreating the layered studio sound in ways even Zeppelin never performed live. If the record features three guitars\, GTLO brings three guitars to the stage. The result is a massive\, immersive wall of sound that stays true to the original recordings while feeling fresh and electrifying in concert. \nDubbed “The American Led Zeppelin\,” GTLO dives deep into the band’s iconic early years while also spotlighting fan-favorite deep cuts rarely heard live. The show also features a special acoustic set\, highlighting the more intimate side of Zeppelin with songs like “Tangerine” and “Hey Hey What Can I Do.” \nWith a strong national touring history and performances at major theaters and performing arts centers across the country\, GTLO is known for delivering Zeppelin’s music with both power and nuance. No costumes\, no gimmicks—just an honest\, heart-pounding celebration of one of rock’s greatest catalogs. For longtime fans and new listeners alike\, a GTLO show captures the light\, shade\, passion\, and fury of “The Mighty Zep” in a truly unforgettable live experience. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance. \n 
